      "number_raw": "100",
      "source_number": "100",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "You see Deputy Kenny.",
      "source_text": "You see Deputy Kenny.",
      "source_line_start": 4,
      "source_line_end": 4,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 4,
      "number": 101,
      "number_raw": "101",
      "source_number": "101",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "If you have business with the Hub police, please talk to Sheriff Greene.  I only take care of his duties when the # Sheriff is unavailable.",
      "source_text": "If you have business with the Hub police, please talk to Sheriff Greene.  I only take care of his duties when the\n # Sheriff is unavailable.",
      "source_line_start": 5,
      "source_line_end": 6,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 5,
      "number": 102,
      "number_raw": "102",
      "source_number": "102",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "I can't believe the Sheriff is really dead.",
      "source_text": "I can't believe the Sheriff is really dead.",
      "source_line_start": 7,
      "source_line_end": 7,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 6,
      "number": 103,
      "number_raw": "103",
      "source_number": "103",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "There you are.  I've been waiting for you to return.  We heard the Sheriff was killed during the battle.  # It's hard to believe he's really gone.  He was like a father to me.",
      "source_text": "There you are.  I've been waiting for you to return.  We heard the Sheriff was killed during the battle.\n  # It's hard to believe he's really gone.  He was like a father to me.",
      "source_line_start": 8,
      "source_line_end": 9,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 7,
      "number": 104,
      "number_raw": "104",
      "source_number": "104",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "The Sheriff gave me instructions to carry out in the event that he did not return from the mission.  He # asked me to give you the remainder of your reward.  I believe it was 1000 caps.  【The Deputy hands you 1000 caps】",
      "source_text": "The Sheriff gave me instructions to carry out in the event that he did not return from the mission.  He\n # asked me to give you the remainder of your reward.  I believe it was 1000 caps.  【The Deputy hands you 1000 caps】",
      "source_line_start": 10,
      "source_line_end": 11,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 8,
      "number": 105,
      "number_raw": "105",
      "source_number": "105",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "This city owes you a debt of thanks.  I only wish the Sheriff could be here to thank you himself.  Goodbye.",
      "source_text": "This city owes you a debt of thanks.  I only wish the Sheriff could be here to thank you himself.  Goodbye.",
      "source_line_start": 12,
      "source_line_end": 12,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 9,
      "number": 106,
      "number_raw": "106",
      "source_number": "106",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Oh my God!  They killed Kenny!  Those bastards!",
      "source_text": "Oh my God!  They killed Kenny!  Those bastards!",
      "source_line_start": 13,
      "source_line_end": 13,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 10,
      "number": 100,
      "number_raw": "100",
      "source_number": "100",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "你看到代理警长肯尼。",
      "source_text": "你看到代理警长肯尼。",
      "source_line_start": 14,
      "source_line_end": 14,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 11,
      "number": 101,
      "number_raw": "101",
      "source_number": "101",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "如果你有事要找哈勃城的警官，请你去和治安官格林说，我只是在警长不在的时候替他处理一些杂事。",
      "source_text": "如果你有事要找哈勃城的警官，请你去和治安官格林说，我只是在警长不在的时候替他处理一些杂事。",
      "source_line_start": 15,
      "source_line_end": 15,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 12,
      "number": 102,
      "number_raw": "102",
      "source_number": "102",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "我不敢相信警长他真的死了。",
      "source_text": "我不敢相信警长他真的死了。",
      "source_line_start": 16,
      "source_line_end": 16,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 13,
      "number": 103,
      "number_raw": "103",
      "source_number": "103",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "你来了啊，我等你很久了。听说警长殉职了，没想到他真的死了。我一直把他当作我的父亲一样。",
      "source_text": "你来了啊，我等你很久了。听说警长殉职了，没想到他真的死了。我一直把他当作我的父亲一样。",
      "source_line_start": 17,
      "source_line_end": 17,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 14,
      "number": 104,
      "number_raw": "104",
      "source_number": "104",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "警长和我们一起执行任务的时候告诉我，如果他没能活着回来，那么就由我把剩余的酬金给你，我想那应该是1000个瓶盖。【代理警长把1000个瓶盖交给你】",
      "source_text": "警长和我们一起执行任务的时候告诉我，如果他没能活着回来，那么就由我把剩余的酬金给你，我想那应该是1000个瓶盖。【代理警长把1000个瓶盖交给你】",
      "source_line_start": 18,
      "source_line_end": 18,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 15,
      "number": 105,
      "number_raw": "105",
      "source_number": "105",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "这座城市欠你太多了。我真希望警长本人能亲自来感谢你！再见了朋友。",
      "source_text": "这座城市欠你太多了。我真希望警长本人能亲自来感谢你！再见了朋友。",
      "source_line_start": 19,
      "source_line_end": 19,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 16,
